<title>INDIA: TABLE-India Ponds 1997 1st half net.</title>
<headline>TABLE-India Ponds 1997 1st half net.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>		(in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	     184.2	vs	  148.6</p>
<p>    Net sales	    2,204.1	vs	1,818.0</p>
<p>    Intrm. div (rupees)    9.5	vs	    7.5</p>
<p>    Other income	    12.2	vs	   11.7</p>
<p>    Expenditure	  1,920.9	vs	1,577.2</p>
<p>    Interest		   4.5	vs	    6.0</p>
<p>    Depreciation	    18.4	vs	   16.0</p>
<p>    Tax			 88.3	vs	   81.9</p>
<p>Note: Cosmetics maker Ponds Ltd is a subsidiary of Anglo-Dutch conglomerate Unielver and part of the Hindustan Lever group.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom (91-22-265 9000)</p>
